# Inputs at a sixth of the width from the axis excite no mode of order 2, 5, 8: two images appear at L_pi / 2 = 46.35 um.
# Reference: a 3 dB split near that length.
title 2x2 multimode interferometer at 0.9 of the 3 dB length
reference 2.8
grid dx=0.02 dz=0.25
window width=16 length=66.75
guide straight x=-1 width=1.2 from=0 to=10
guide straight x=0 width=6 from=10 to=51.75
guide straight x=1 width=1.2 from=51.75 to=66.75
guide straight x=-1 width=1.2 from=51.75 to=66.75
launch mode x=-1 width=1.2
monitor bar z=66.75 x=-1 width=1.2
monitor cross z=66.75 x=1 width=1.2
plane end z=66.75
expect power bar 0.216899940 2e-7
expect power cross 0.292916356 2e-7
expect total end 0.997776434 2e-7
expect centroid end 0.1966037 2e-6
expect radius end 3.8802030 2e-6
expect neff 2.824706188 2e-8
